    }
   ]
  },
  "steps": [
   "X8 generates the Submit ID, writes the start message to the log (LOG1) and starts this batch. The screen returns to the delivery plan and shows the Submit ID.",
   "Read the ASN draft of the session from #TEMP_ASN_DRAFT. Take the ASN No and one Case No per case from the existing numbering (last sequence table).",
   "Insert TB_R_ASN_CROSSDOCK_H (ASN_STATUS '1' Created) and TB_R_ASN_CROSSDOCK_D (refer Data Edit Mapping).",
   "No error: commit, write the result (LOG2) and end (LOG3) messages. Error: roll back, release the mapping of the draft (PO_MAPPED_FLAG back to 'N', mapped qty back), write the error (LOG4). Exit."
  ]
 },
